Blockchain-Based Student Attendance System

Project Overview

This project is a blockchain-based student attendance management system developed using Ethereum smart contracts. It helps maintain transparent, secure, and reliable student attendance records.

Technologies Used

- Solidity
- Remix IDE
- Ethereum Sepolia Test Network
- MetaMask
- HTML
- CSS
- JavaScript
- Ethers.js

Main Features

- Connect MetaMask wallet
- Register students
- Mark students as Present or Absent
- View student details
- View attendance history
- Check attendance percentage
- Store attendance records on the blockchain

Smart Contract

The smart contract is written in Solidity and deployed on the Ethereum Sepolia test network.

Project Files

- "StudentAttendance.sol" – Smart contract
- "index.html" – Website structure
- "style.css" – Website design
- "app.js" – Blockchain interaction and application logic

Network

Ethereum Sepolia Test Network

Deployment

The application connects to the deployed smart contract using MetaMask.

